{"date": "2026-10-15", "word": "Light", "summary": "A light day (forecast light). The upslope ran from about 08:00 to about 16:15. Cloudbase held 4,000\u20134,900 ft; the forecast had 4,300\u20135,700. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway between Pukalani and Omaopio; about 15:22 it was crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio.", "therm": "<strong>Light</strong> for the day, 10:00\u201314:00<div class=\"sub\">Kula Ag's measured air through the NAM sounding (thermal.py); forecast was Light</div>", "base": "<span class=\"num\">4,000\u20134,900 ft</span><div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations during the upslope; the chart above sets it against the forecast</div>", "chart": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;border-top:2px dashed #eb6834;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Forecast</span>\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:12px;height:10px;background:rgba(137,135,129,.18);vertical-align:middle\"></span> Upslope</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase against the forecast through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations every 15 minutes during the upslope; forecast by hour, a later run (the morning forecast was not saved).</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var d = {\"derived\": [[480, 4510.0], [495, 4560.0], [510, 4360.0], [525, 4120.0], [540, 4050.0], [555, 4200.0], [570, 4230.0], [585, 4520.0], [600, 4610.0], [615, 4690.0], [630, 4650.0], [645, 4700.0], [660, 4740.0], [675, 4800.0], [690, 4610.0], [705, 4560.0], [720, 4580.0], [735, 4560.0], [750, 4610.0], [765, 4540.0], [780, 4430.0], [795, 4490.0], [810, 4630.0], [825, 4710.0], [840, 4670.0], [855, 4730.0], [870, 4870.0], [885, 4940.0], [900, 4830.0], [915, 4700.0], [930, 4430.0], [945, 4430.0], [960, 4390.0], [975, 4290.0]], \"forecast\": [[540, 5260.0], [600, 5560.0], [660, 5660.0], [720, 5260.0], [780, 4360.0], [840, 4260.0], [900, 4460.0]], \"up\": [480, 975]}, pt = function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1]}; };\n  var dark = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches, muted = '#898781', grid = dark ? '#2c2c2a' : '#e1e0d9';\n  var band = { id: 'band', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.up) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.14)';\n    g.fillRect(x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.top, x.getPixelForValue(d.up[1]) - x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.bottom - a.top); g.restore(); } };\n  var hm = function (m) { return String(Math.floor(m / 60)).padStart(2, '0') + ':' + String(m % 60).padStart(2, '0'); };\n  var ys = d.derived.concat(d.forecast).map(function (a) { return a[1]; });\n  new Chart(document.getElementById('basechart'), {\n    type: 'line',\n    data: { datasets: [\n      { label: 'Derived', data: d.derived.map(pt), borderColor: '#2a78d6', borderWidth: 2, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Forecast', data: d.forecast.map(pt), borderColor: '#eb6834', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [6, 4], pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#eb6834', tension: 0.3 }\n    ] },\n    options: { responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false, interaction: { mode: 'nearest', axis: 'x', intersect: false },\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false }, tooltip: { callbacks: {\n        title: function (i) { return hm(i[0].parsed.x); },\n        label: function (i) { return i.dataset.label + ': ' + Math.round(i.parsed.y).toLocaleString() + ' ft'; } } } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { type: 'linear', min: 480, max: 1020, ticks: { stepSize: 60, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return hm(v); } }, grid: { display: false } },\n        y: { min: Math.min(3500, Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              max: Math.max(7000, Math.ceil(Math.max.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              ticks: { stepSize: 500, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return v.toLocaleString(); } }, grid: { color: grid } }\n      } },\n    plugins: [band]\n  });\n})();\n</script>", "line": "Crossing Kula Highway between Pukalani and Omaopio<div class=\"sub\">Most of the day, 45 updates. Furthest south about 15:22: Crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio</div>", "up": "<span class=\"num\">08:00</span> to about <span class=\"num\">16:15</span>", "wind": "<span class=\"num\">4 mph</span>, gusts to 13<div class=\"sub\">Lower elevations, during the upslope</div>"}